        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: H Kaufman\n- Organizations: New South Wales Rugby League, Australian Rugby League Commission\n- Places: New South Wales, Australian Capital Territory, Sydney\n- Sports: Rugby league\n\nFacts:\n- The New South Wales Rugby League was formed in Sydney on 8 August 1907.\n- The New South Wales Rugby League was known as the New South Wales Rugby Football League until 1984.\n- The New South Wales Rugby League is the governing body of rugby league in New South Wales and the Australian Capital Territory.\n- The New South Wales Rugby League is a member of the Australian Rugby League Commission.\n- H Kaufman was a rugby league player in the Australian competition called the New South Wales Rugby League.",
